---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { labSamples } from '../../data/labSamples';
import { publicCrates } from '../../data/profile';
---
<Base lang="en" title="Technical lab | Miguel Quevedo" description="Public Rust crates with green GitHub Actions CI and standalone samples in C, Assembly, C++, Swift and PHP.">
  <main id="contenido" class="detail-main wrap">
    <a class="back-link" href="/en/">← Back to portfolio</a>
    <div class="detail-hero">
      <h1>Technical lab</h1>
      <p class="detail-lede">Standalone open-source repositories independent from Meson with green Ubuntu and Windows CI alongside isolated reproducible engineering samples.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-grid">
      {publicCrates.map((crate) => (
        <article>
          <span class="lab-card-label">Public repository with green CI</span>
          <h2>{crate.en.title}</h2>
          <p>{crate.en.lead}</p>
          <p class="lab-stack-line">{crate.stack.join(' · ')} · {crate.en.status}</p>
          <div class="lab-links">
            <a class="text-link" style="margin-top:0" href={crate.repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open GitHub repo ↗</a>
            <a class="text-link" style="margin-top:0" href={crate.ciUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View Actions CI ↗</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="lab-grid" style="margin-top:24px;">
      <article>
        <span class="lab-card-label">Rust sample</span>
        <h2>Local synchronization</h2>
        <p>Vector clocks, concurrent changes and pending operations until acknowledgment. Five tests executed.</p>
        <p class="lab-stack-line">Rust · Verified</p>
        <div class="lab-links"><a class="text-link" style="margin-top:0" href="/en/samples/local-sync/">View sample ↗</a></div>
      </article>
      {labSamples.map((sample) => (
        <article>
          <span class="lab-card-label">{sample.verified ? 'Verified' : 'Execution pending'}</span>
          <h2>{sample.en.title}</h2>
          <p>{sample.en.lead}</p>
          <p class="lab-stack-line">{sample.stack.join(' · ')}</p>
          <div class="lab-links"><a class="text-link" style="margin-top:0" href={`/en/samples/${sample.slug}/`}>View sample ↗</a></div>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="lab-note"><strong>What this proves</strong><p>Alongside Meson architecture previews and live web deployments, these standalone repositories expose inspectable Rust, C99 shared-library FFI, Dart outbox/bindings, x64 Assembly, C++, PHP and Swift implementations with reproducible verification commands.</p></div>
  </main>
</Base>
